\par 
\par \fs20 0\tab OK\tab Socket operation okay or timeout.
\par 4\tab SOCK_INTR\tab System level interrupt interrupted socket operation.
\par 9\tab SOCK_BAD\tab Generic error for invalid format, bad format.
\par 13\tab SOCK_ACCESS\tab Generic error for access violation.
\par 14\tab SOCK_FAULT\tab Generic error for fault.
\par 22\tab SOCK_INVALID\tab Generic error for invalid format, entry, etc.
\par 24\tab SOCK_FILE\tab Generic error for file error.
\par 25\tab SOCK_BADDR\tab The IP address provided is not valid or the host specified by the IP does not exist.
\par \pard\tx675\tx3965 38\tab SOCK_NOSOCK\tab Invalid socket or not connected to remote.
